Data

The data built into index.html, Cost_Converter_Workings.xlsx and data/raw/ come
from the World Bank (World Development Indicators), the OECD and the IMF (World
Economic Outlook). World Bank and OECD data are licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0); IMF data are used
under the IMF's terms of use. Attribute them as listed in README.md.
